---
import '../../styles/handoff-system.css';
---
<section class="ts-system d-section" id="how-it-works" aria-labelledby="ts-title"><div class="d-wrap">
 <div class="d-heading"><div><p class="ts-eyebrow">How Russound comes together</p><h2 id="ts-title">From a favorite song{' '}<br/>to every listening space.</h2></div><p>The music comes in. Your system sends it where you want it. Amplification powers the speakers, and you choose what plays.</p></div>
 <div class="ts-flow">
  <div class="ts-stage ts-sources"><p class="ts-step"><span>01</span> Your music</p><div class="ts-source-list"><span>Music streaming</span><span>TV sound</span><span>Connected audio sources</span></div><p class="ts-note">Choose the sources that suit the system and the way you listen.</p></div>
  <div class="ts-stage ts-system-stage"><p class="ts-step"><span>02</span> Choose a system</p><a class="ts-family" href="/audio-systems/#multiroom"><img src="/oct27/smz8.webp" alt="" width="330" height="195" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Multi-Room Controllers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Music and control for rooms throughout the home.</p></div></a><a class="ts-family" href="/audio-systems/#streaming"><img src="/media/mbx-amp.webp" alt="" width="330" height="195" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Streamers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Another starting point, for one room or several.</p></div></a>
   <div class="ts-control-branch">
    <div class="ts-control-connector" aria-hidden="true"><span>Control the system</span></div>
    <a class="ts-family ts-connectivity" href="/connectivity-control/"><img src="/media/xts7.webp" alt="" width="140" height="100" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Connectivity &amp; Control <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Choose what plays with controls and connections matched to your system.</p></div></a>
   </div>
  </div>
  <div class="ts-stage"><p class="ts-step"><span>03</span> Power the sound</p><a class="ts-family ts-power" href="/catalog/?family=amplifiers"><img src="/oct27/amplifier.webp" alt="" width="330" height="195" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>Amplifiers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Power matched to your speakers and spaces.</p></div></a><p class="ts-note">Some systems include amplification. The SMZ8 powers six zones directly; other zones or systems use separate amplifiers.</p></div>
  <div class="ts-stage"><p class="ts-step"><span>04</span> Bring it to life</p><a class="ts-family" href="/catalog/?family=speakers&group=architectural"><img class="ts-speaker" src="/media/ic620.webp" alt="" width="195" height="195" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>In-ceiling speakers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Sound designed into the room.</p></div></a><a class="ts-family" href="/catalog/?family=speakers&use=outdoors"><img class="ts-speaker" src="/oct27/outdoor.webp" alt="" width="195" height="195" loading="lazy"/><div><h3>OutBack speakers <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3><p>Take the listening outside.</p></div></a></div>
 </div>
 <div class="ts-system-note"><p>Your installer brings the right pieces together.</p><a class="d-link" href="#planner">Start with your rooms <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div>
 </div></section>
